ore quorum (`!quorumReached`), the original proposer can cancel immediately.         - Once quorum is reached, canceling requires `threshold` committee cancel confirmations."},"emergencyPause(string)":{"notice":"Immediate zero-delay emergency brake callable by any committee member or mintOperator."},"relayMintSERG(address,uint256,bytes32)":{"notice":"Strictly restricted to designated `mintOperator` (never 1-of-n committee [H-4])."},"rescueERC20(address,address,uint256)":{"notice":"Recover ERC-20 tokens (e.g., sERG fees mistakenly withdrawn to timelock) via         t-of-n timelocked self-call ([L-1])."},"setMintOperator(address)":{"notice":"Rotate or disable the operational hot mintOperator via t-of-n timelocked self-call."}},"notice":"Eliminates single-EOA admin risk on Frontier EVM by owning ErgoBridge.sol:         - Operational `relayMintSERG` / `relayUpdateErgoState` is restricted strictly to the           designated `mintOperator` (NEVER 1-of-n individual committee members [H-4]).         - Fast `emergencyPause(reason)` can be triggered immediately by ANY committee member           or `mintOperator` with zero delay when solvency breaks.         - All privileged admin actions (`withdrawFees`, `unpause`, `transferOwnership`,           `setMintOperator`, `rescueERC20`) require `threshold`-of-`n` committee approval PLUS           a mandatory on-chain `adminDelaySeconds` timelock, expire after `GRACE_PERIOD_SECONDS`           ([M-3]), and can be canceled by `threshold` committee members prior to execution.","version":1}},"settings":{"compilationTarget":{"BridgeCommitteeTimelock.sol":"BridgeCommitteeTimelock"},"evmVersion":"osaka","libraries":{},"metadata":{"bytecodeHash":"ipfs"},"optimizer":{"enabled":true,"runs":200},"remappings":[]},"sources":{"@openzeppelin/contracts/token/ERC20/IERC20.sol":{"keccak256":"0x74ed01eb66b923d0d0cfe3be84604ac04b76482a55f9dd655e1ef4d367f95bc2","license":"MIT","urls":["bzz-raw://5282825a626cfe924e504274b864a652b0023591fa66f06a067b25b51ba